# Internal docs — only README.md and README-v1-archive.md are public.
# Blanket-ignore .md in the project root rather than listing files one by
# one: the explicit list (CLAUDE.md, v3-findings.md, v4-findings.md, ...)
# had to be hand-updated every time a new internal doc was created, and
# five new ones (v5-action-plan.md, v5-improvement-proposals.md,
# fable5-value-assessment.md, github-stats-log.md,
# v3-v4-findings-dependency-map.md) were missed this way on 2026-07-29 —
# caught only by checking `git status` before a push, not by this file.
*.md
!README.md
!README-v1-archive.md
ideas/
__pycache__/

# Reports — keep folder tracked but exclude generated reports
reports/*.md
!reports/.gitkeep
